. Can you fight your way back home?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/0f69aee5fc4b10b39967af3e34771167.poster.avif?t=1660867163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/0f69aee5fc4b10b39967af3e34771167.webm?t=1660867163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Weapon Synergy: </strong>Combine weapons in unique ways, completely changing the gameplay. Try and see which combinations are strongest!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/eace8f58f44897c4d10758b8df85d730.poster.avif?t=1660867163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/eace8f58f44897c4d10758b8df85d730.webm?t=1660867163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Travel through multiple levels and biomes with our exiled heroes as they fend off hordes of enemies to find their way to the old Sanctuary they once called home.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/8974f805b503aff78fd7e6c8acdedaa5.poster.avif?t=1660867163\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072080/extras/8974f805b503aff78fd7e6c8acdedaa5.webm?t=1660867163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Hordes of Hordes:</strong> Fight horde after horde of dozens of different enemies. An infinite amount of demons, devils, natural abominations, and all sorts of other creeping, crawling, slithering hell-spawn are waiting for you.<br><br>- Play as 5 of the 12 unique custom heroes, each with unique attacks<br>- Fight across 4 of 8 intended biomes in story mode, or Endless mode, where the real game begins<br>- Battle against 20 of 70 planned enemies, each with it's own strengths and weaknesses<br>- Colect multiple runes/gems allowing weapon customization for endless replayability<br>- Listen to 4 of 10 custom tracks, made just for the game",
